message: "If you use this corpus or pipeline in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Computational corpus and Textual Emotion Classification (TEC) pipeline for Saint Neophytos the Recluse's Ten Discourses on Christ's Commandments"
abstract: >-
  Preprocessing pipeline and few-shot emotion classification workflow for the
  Ten Discourses on Christ's Commandments (Δέκα Λόγοι περὶ τοῦ Χριστοῦ Ἐντολῶν)
  of Saint Neophytos the Recluse (Neophytos / Neofytos, 1134 - c. 1214).
  Part of a postdoctoral project at the University of Nicosia on computational
  sentiment and emotion analysis of Byzantine patristic Greek. It continues the
  author's PhD research on the use of Holy Scripture in Neophytos's works.
